    "Content": "<p>In late December 2022, version 7 of the AzAcSnap tool was released.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fazure-netapp-files%2Fazacsnap-introduction&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cjiteshmani%40microsoft.com%7C73458b3b3faf46d0041008dae83f62d4%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638077656189650675%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=4dDeM%2BGAyFtKy2GZHWQv11QXpm80q%2BZxWHvyfPJKUsg%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-netapp-files/azacsnap-introduction. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Application Consistent Snapshot Tool</a>&nbsp;(AzAcSnap) is a command-line tool that enables customers to simplify data protection for third-party databases in Linux environments.&nbsp;AzAcSnap 7 introduces the following new capabilities and improvements:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Azure Backup integration improvements</li>\r\n\t<li>Preliminary support for&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fazure-netapp-files%2Fbackup-introduction&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cjiteshmani%40microsoft.com%7C73458b3b3faf46d0041008dae83f62d4%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638077656189650675%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=TpGrKVntATddkhoE03D97kdKI6fdAnHXrC1L27hLHts%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-netapp-files/backup-introduction. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure NetApp Files backup</a>&nbsp;(<i>Preview</i>)</li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ibm.com%2Fproducts%2Fdb2&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cjiteshmani%40microsoft.com%7C73458b3b3faf46d0041008dae83f62d4%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638077656189650675%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=ZPoDYO%2BhsJyIbgRTK0prwLPmg55l3V7V8dBc0p1taoc%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://www.ibm.com/products/db2. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IBM Db2 database</a>&nbsp;support adding options to configure, test, and snapshot backup IBM Db2 in an application consistent manner (<i>Preview</i>)</li>\r\n\t<li>Shortening of snapshot names</li>\r\n\t<li>Restore (<code>-c restore</code>)&amp; Test (<code>-c test</code>) improvements</li>\r\n\t<li>Validation &amp; Timeout improvements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Download the latest release of the installer&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2Fazacsnapinstaller&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cjiteshmani%40microsoft.com%7C73458b3b3faf46d0041008dae83f62d4%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638077656189650675%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=gD9Sg5cmiBYkXQjml3H4Ls12J2e9%2B1bpFGgR8IjpNik%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://aka.ms/azacsnapinstaller. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "In late December 2022, version 7 of the AzAcSnap tool was released. Azure Application Consistent Snapshot Tool (AzAcSnap) is a command-line tool that enables customers to simplify data protection for third-party databases in Linux environments. AzAcSnap 7 introduces the following new capabilities and improvements:\n\nAzure Backup integration improvements\n\nPreliminary support for Azure NetApp Files backup ( Preview )\n\nIBM Db2 database support adding options to configure, test, and snapshot backup IBM Db2 in an application consistent manner ( Preview )\n\nShortening of snapshot names\n\nRestore ( -c restore )& Test ( -c test ) improvements\n\nValidation & Timeout improvements\n\nDownload the latest release of the installer here ."
  },
